{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】國家主席習近平將與俄羅斯總統普京及美國總統特朗普在深圳APEC期間舉行歷史性三方會談，預料有甚麼關鍵議題？如何影響世界大局？</p>\n<p>周二的《時事全方位》，請來專家分析。</p>\n<p>題目：前瞻中俄美元首會晤</p>\n<p>熱線電話：1833298</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T13:53:28.971183+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":115,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T13:38:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T13:47:00.656920+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T13:47:00.656920+00:00","content_hash":"5ea6f58a04bc454e596ae4d4112d88d10bea5d8792eec093602480ce2a9146d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}